<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-15T23:02:12.142Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:02:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Australia and the Philippines signed a defence agreement to counter heightened tensions in the South China Sea, while China deployed unauthorized buoys that the Philippines says create maritime hazards and continued patrols near contested features. The Philippine Coast Guard removed oil from a sunken landing craft tank off Surigao del Sur, and the Philippine 10ID and partners held an intelligence workshop to boost cooperation. Canada and the Philippines concluded talks on a free-trade deal, deepening economic ties. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/the-philippines-and-australia-strengthen-joint-military-deterrence-at-asean-summit&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/15/australia-and-philippines-sign-new-defence-pact-amid-south-china-sea-tensions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/15/southeast-asian-leaders-open-asean-summit-with-south-china-sea-energy-agenda/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNLWtfU0tTallmSTNzSmZKOU9KVlRyalhxM1ZJaWphN3c0eHRIalJaUVNpWTdvTzRQWmZ4WHl6YW9qYmJwMUl1aDZIQlA3UGFBY21ka0xsbjNnWExMMWRJdzNkcFFjRnJpZVVoQmNLbm9xT0R0U2l0U3IzWlVEX3RENXNIQmJYWDQ0dnEyV2EzVFNVeS1rQWxMcTNuazVuODVtci02VmNvenFiSlg4em1PaWIwRkpkR0JH0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1XeVBEYmozamdmTXpQc2h1Tnp5TVZJeEU0dVVnQnd0VnRCc1dPU19FSHpjM0J1WjJVUWFLUE5SZjV5MzNnbks0R2Vmd3lXQTRsd1hLeTF2ZjdvTkNJZ1RwYi1UcGRhU09pZS0zVXlvN3NfaW92WEZ3MGdHWlJ6ek10TjZ1MzM2MzN5VXc4QlhuTXVhS0pyM0N6NmtfdTRubmkyamJabHBOVklVemM1S1dJUHZHUTYzZXpMd3k3X3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera